IMPORT solution

`eligible` MEANS Applicant WITH
    `years of continuous residence` IS 5
    `months physically present`     IS 30
    `months in the district`        IS 3
    `resided since applying`        IS TRUE
    `good moral character`          IS TRUE

`too little presence` MEANS Applicant WITH
    `years of continuous residence` IS 5
    `months physically present`     IS 29
    `months in the district`        IS 3
    `resided since applying`        IS TRUE
    `good moral character`          IS TRUE

`no good character` MEANS Applicant WITH
    `years of continuous residence` IS 9
    `months physically present`     IS 60
    `months in the district`        IS 12
    `resided since applying`        IS TRUE
    `good moral character`          IS FALSE

#ASSERT `may be naturalized` `eligible` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `may be naturalized` `too little presence` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `may be naturalized` `no good character` EQUALS FALSE
